    "detailed_description": "Unending is a roguelite-puzzle anthology.<br><br>It explores a specific type of turn-based combat familiar to players of traditional roguelikes, broughlikes, and grid-based combat games.<br><br>In Unending you get to play:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Puzzles: Over 100 short challenges.<br></li><li> Dungeons:  A selection of roguelite gauntlets featuring bespoke mechanics.</li></ul><br>This game is a sequel to Ending, a flash / mobile game. An approximate recreation of that game's dungeon and levels can be played in this game.<br><br>Unending is an open-ended project. Designed to receive new mechanics, puzzles, dungeons, and accessibility features - as and when the developer finds time or inspiration.",
